<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Bulletin Template</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as primary */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; /* Using sans-serif for headings */
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-size: 24pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 14pt;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 16pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 60px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 28pt; margin: 0;">UNIVERSITY OF WYOMING</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 10px;">GEORGE C. FRISON INSTITUTE</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 5px;">OF ARCHAEOLOGY AND ANTHROPOLOGY</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">BULLETIN # {{ bulletin_number }}</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 10px;">Spring {{ year }}</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>Dear Volunteer/Visitor,</p>
    <p>This letter is to inform you about conditions, schedules and directions to the Black Mountain Archaeological District and Last Canyon Cave field projects. For directions to campsites please contact the principal investigator or <span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span> ({{ contact_phone }}). Work is broken down into 10-day sessions with four-day breaks. The work dates for each ten-day session of the projects are:</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">2010 Frison Institute Project Dates</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Project</th>
        <th style="width: 70%;">Dates</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Last Canyon:</td>
        <td>{{ last_canyon_dates }}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>White Creek Canyon/Two Moon Shelter/BA Cave:</td>
        <td>{{ white_creek_dates }}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>Please arrive at the lodging dock on the first day of the project to load equipment. May 14 at 7am, June 25 at 6am. The difference in time of meeting is related to the duration of driving time to the base camp. If you wish to drive your own vehicle be aware that you need a high profile 4-wheel drive to reach the Big Horn Mountain (Black Mountain) base camp. It may also be necessary for you to either take a passenger or park your vehicle and drive the university vehicle to base camp. So pack accordingly. We will try to accommodate your wishes about driving your own or in the university vehicle, but must plan for contingencies. Also please plan to return to Laramie on June 20, and July 18 to unload equipment and collections.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Map of Wyoming</h3>
      <!-- Placeholder for map image -->
      <div style="height: 300px; border: 1px solid #ccc; text-align: center; line-height: 300px;">[Wyoming Map Placeholder]</div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Black Mountain Field Camp Directions</h3>
      <p>Find Shell Wyoming on Wyoming highway map (top map). From Shell, follow the Trapper Creek road east for about 3 miles (bottom map). At the end of the pavement turn left across the creek and around Chimney Rock. From this point on you will need a 4-wheel drive. Follow the Black Mountain Road for about 7 miles. The turn off from the Black Mountain Road will be flagged. The road is quite rough in places even for a 4-wheel drive and following a guide vehicle is recommended. (Contact the Institute regarding time of your arrival.)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Last Canyon Cave Field Camp</h3>
      <p>La Ranchita de Montañas Pryor</p>
      <p>870 Road 1 1/2</p>
      <p>Deaver, WY 82421</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Directions to Last Canyon Cave Field Camp</h3>
      <p>From Laramie, take preferred route to Thermopolis via Casper or Riverton. From Thermopolis, travel to Greybull via Worland and Basin (WY 789, US 16, 20). Continue through Greybull towards Cody. Just outside of Greybull, turn right towards Lovell (WY 789, US 310). Continue through Lovell to Deaver, WY 82421. Turn onto Central Ave (CR 1) in Deaver. Turn right on West Park, then turn left on 2nd Ave W. 2nd Ave W becomes Road 1. Continue on Road 1 and bear left at fork with Lane 9, then turn right on Road 1 1/2. End almost immediately at 870 Road 1 1/2 (on right). (For location of Deaver, see top map on previous page)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Volunteer and Crew Application Form*</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(One per applicant)</p>

    <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Volunteer</td>
        <td style="width: 80%;"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Crew</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Name:</td>
        <td><span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span></td>
        <td>Soc. Sec. No.</td>
        <td><span data-field="ssn">{{ ssn }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Address:</td>
        <td><span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span></td>
        <td>Zip</td>
        <td><span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>City</td>
        <td><span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span></td>
        <td>State</td>
        <td><span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Phone:</td>
        <td><span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span></td>
        <td>E-mail:</td>
        <td><span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>I am interested in volunteering/working (circle one) for the <span data-field="project_name">{{ project_name }}</span> in which you wish to participate), between <span data-field="start_date">{{ start_date }}</span> month <span data-field="start_day">{{ start_day }}</span> day and <span data-field="end_date">{{ end_date }}</span> month <span data-field="end_day">{{ end_day }}</span> day, 2010.</p>
      <p>Volunteers are asked to participate for at least five days. If you wish to volunteer for multiple projects please copy this form and fill out a separate form for each project.</p>
      <p>Will you need transportation from Laramie to the field site? <span data-field="needs_transport">{{ needs_transport }}</span></p>
      <p>Do you have medical insurance? <span data-field="has_insurance">{{ has_insurance }}</span></p>
      <p>Do you have any medical problems we should be aware of? <span data-field="has_medical_problems">{{ has_medical_problems }}</span></p>
      <p>We may be in some isolated places without access to emergency services and it is critical for us to plan as much as possible; please describe your medical problems below:</p>
      <div style="height: 80px; border: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 15px;"></div>
      <p>If you have an expected medical condition that might require immediate treatment (for example allergic reaction to bees), please describe in detail below and on the back of this sheet what we need to do:</p>
      <div style="height: 80px; border: 1px solid #000; margin-bottom: 15px;"></div>
      <p>Would you be willing to pay $15/day for the time you spend as a volunteer to help support this project? <span data-field="willing_to_pay">{{ willing_to_pay }}</span></p>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 30px;">* This application form is required for your participation in the project.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">George C. Frison Institute</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Department of Anthropology</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Dept. 3431, 1000 E. University</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Laramie, WY 82071-3431</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">or submit by email to: <span data-field="institute_email">{{ institute_email }}</span></p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Volunteers: Please mail this form at least two weeks before the beginning of any project you wish to work on.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">By submitting this form you authorize the University of Wyoming, its agents, successors, and assigns, to use and reproduce photographs(s) in which you appear in official UW publications, and I waive any right that I may have to inspect and approve said photograph (or any copy that may be used in connection therewith) or to receive compensation for the use of said photograph.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Because you have to drive a University vehicle in an emergency we strongly recommend that you acquire an <span data-field="insurance_type">{{ insurance_type }}</span> from your automobile insurance carrier.</p>

    <div class="signature-line">
      <div>
        <p>Name:</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 300px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Signature:</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 300px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Date:</p>
        <div style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 300px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>